      "created_at": "2022-12-15T20:28:46Z",
      "updated_at": "2022-12-15T20:28:46Z",
      "body": "Vercel doesn't have your geo location, it has a broad approximation of it based on your IP address, probably using general accessible IP-to-location databases. And without your IP no web server could respond to your requests.",
