      "body": "@dummdidumm you are correct about using the IP address; however, some people may disagree with the additional processing because, in the case of the edge API, just knowing what city the user is in could definitely scare the user into thinking that the website knows their exact location. I do not think Vercel is that transparent about *how* IP addresses are processed either.",
