      "updated_at": "2022-12-16T21:54:15Z",
      "body": "Everyone, I just got the results of a GDPR scan with [Sovy](https://www.sovy.com/gdpr-scan/), and the [report](https://hub.sovy.com/gdpr-scan/?siteid=bd1a897b-eb16-41a7-8567-3f45058afae3) is not pretty. Essentially, where 100% is fully compliant, the SvelteKit website got a 10% score because it violated 9 parts of the GDPR, and a few of those involve what is being discussed here.\r\n\r\n*(Note that the report will expire in **three** weeks)*",
